              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eizooba rimwe ku baabaire nibaziika omuntu, baareeba omutwe gw'abanyagi, baamutambika omu kituuro kya Elisa; omutumbi ku gwahikire guti ha magufa ga Elisa, ogwo muntu yaahimbuuka, yaimuka, yaayemerera.",
          "type": "text",
